      "content": "idk, i just had a massive migraine like this last year and the doctor said it was just aura. it's probably just the same thing happening again, right? the arm thing is weird but maybe it's just because i'm tense from the pain. i'd rather just take some more of my usual migraine meds and sleep it off. do you think it's safe to just double my dose of sumatriptan for this one since it feels so much stronger?",
