      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get it but i really dont want to deal with the er right now, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours. if i just take my sumatriptan and then maybe some extra ibuprofen to help with the pain, would that be okay to get through the night? i'm pretty sure it's just a bad migraine and i'll be fine by morning if i just rest.",
